					<p class="body1" align="left"><span class="body1 style73"> <h2>News archive</h2><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-10-04 | Thursday</font></strong><br><br>Family,<br /><br />I&#39;m proud to announce that the first ever Massline short film <strong><u>MANOJ</u>,</strong> directed by <strong>Zia Mohajerjasbi</strong> and written by <strong>Hari Kondabolu</strong>, will be playing <strong>TWICE </strong>in the next couple of days in film festivals in Seattle.<br /><br />When, you ask? I&#39;ll tell you:<br /><br /><strong><u>TODAY</u>,</strong> <strong>Oct. 4th, </strong><strong>7pm</strong> in the <strong>4th Annual Independent South Asian Film Festival</strong>. <em>Broadway Performance Hall, 1625 Broadway Ave. Seattle, WA, 98122. <strong>TICKETS FREE!!!</strong><br /></em><br />It will precede the film, <u><strong>Anuranan</strong></u>. <br /><a href="http://isaff.tasveer.org/2007/program.php?id=2#ev_16"><strong>http://isaff.tasveer.org/2007/program.php?id=2#ev_16</strong></a><br /><br /><br /><strong><u>SUNDAY</u>,</strong> <strong>Oct. 7th, </strong><strong>9:15 pm</strong> in the <strong>NWFF&#39;s 10th Annual Local Sightings Film Festival.</strong> <em>Northwest Film Forum, 1515 12th Ave, Seattle WA 98122. Tickets $8<br /><br /></em>It will be played in the &quot;Points of View&quot; section. <br /><a href="http://www.nwfilmforum.org/localsightings/schedule.php"><strong>http://www.nwfilmforum.org/localsightings/schedule.php</strong></a><br /><br />Much love,<br /><br />The aforementioned Hari Kondabolu<p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-10-04 | Thursday</font></strong><br><br><img src="http://image.listen.com/img/356x237/3/1/8/0/650813_356x237.jpg" alt="" width="356" height="237" /><br /><br />LL Cool J - New York Gangstas:<br /><br />http://www.zshare.net/audio/400636775a65bf/<br /><br />Thoughts on the new LL? Post it up on the forums!<br /><br />Peace<br />daps1<p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-10-03 | Wednesday</font></strong><br><br><img src="http://i22.tinypic.com/2j3smr7.jpg" alt="" width="430" height="282" /><br /><br /><br /><font size="4"><span style="color: #ff0000; font-weight: bold">&quot;FILTHY FRIDAYS&quot;</span><br /><span style="font-weight: bold"><br /><br /><br />With DJs Daps1 + Sam Israel (aka RA Scion of Common Market/Massline)</span><br /><span style="font-weight: bold">Hidmo Eritrean Cuisine (20th and Jackson)</span><br /><span style="font-weight: bold"><br /><br /><br />10:00pm - 1:30am<br /></span><br /><span style="font-weight: bold">FREE!<br /><br />EVERY FRIDAY IN OCTOBER!<br /><br />Peace<br />daps1<br /></span></font><p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-10-02 | Tuesday</font></strong><br><br>wattup foos.&nbsp; this weekend we&#39;ll be shooting the video for <strong>Joe Metro</strong>, in preparation for the release of the first EP of this fall.<br /><br />we&#39;ll post some pictures for your peeping pleasure... cough.<br /><br />in the meantime, you can download the original version of <strong>Gabriel Teodros&#39; &quot;No Label.&quot;</strong>&nbsp; due to sample clearance issues, we were unable to release it.&nbsp; so hey, free song.<br /><br />saba<p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-09-29 | Saturday</font></strong><br><br>i spent friday with my buddy <strong>Martin Feveyear</strong> at <strong>Jupiter Studios</strong> in Wallingford.  we&#39;re mixing the new cuts for the forthcoming EP projects from your friends, Blue Scholars.<br /><strong><br />Blue Scholars - Joe Metro EP</strong>  <em>Late October</em><br /><strong><br />Blue Scholars - BUTTER&amp;GUN$ EP</strong> <em>sometime after Late October<br /></em><br />these digital releases will be accompanied by more filthy videography from your other friend, <strong>Zia Mohajerjasbi</strong>.<br /><br />Martin&#39;s studio is kinda off the hook. real spacious and relaxed.  reminds you of your friend&#39;s garage w/a couch you used to kick it in on hot summer days.<br /> <img src="http://www.masslinemedia.com/images/jupiter/pic1.jpg" alt="" /><br /><img src="http://www.masslinemedia.com/images/jupiter/pic2.jpg" alt="" /><br /><img src="http://www.masslinemedia.com/images/jupiter/jupitersign.jpg" alt="" /><br /><img src="http://www.masslinemedia.com/images/jupiter/pic3.jpg" alt="" /><br /><img src="http://www.masslinemedia.com/images/jupiter/pic4.jpg" alt="" /><br /><br />even <strong>Macklemore</strong> came by to drop off his verse for the <strong>North By Northwest Remix</strong> that <strong>Jake One</strong> did.<br /><br />
<img src="http://www.masslinemedia.com/images/jupiter/mack.jpg" alt="" />

<br /><br />keep an eye out!<br /><br />saba<p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><center><div class="pagenumbers"><A HREF="archive.php?from=65">[&lt;&lt;]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=0">[1]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=5">[2]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=10">[3]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=15">[4]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=20">[5]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=25">[6]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=30">[7]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=35">[8]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=40">[9]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=45">[10]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=50">[11]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=55">[12]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=60">[13]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=65">[14]</A> [15] <A HREF="archive.php?from=75">[16]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=80">[17]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=85">[18]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=90">[19]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=95">[20]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=100">[21]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=105">[22]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=110">[23]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=115">[24]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=120">[25]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=125">[26]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=130">[27]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=135">[28]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=140">[29]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=145">[30]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=150">[31]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=155">[32]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=160">[33]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=165">[34]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=170">[35]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=175">[36]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=180">[37]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=185">[38]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=190">[39]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=195">[40]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=200">[41]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=205">[42]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=210">[43]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=215">[44]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=220">[45]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=225">[46]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=230">[47]</A> 